  {
   "id": 27,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    1560,
    800
   ],
   "size": [
    340,
    330
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 0,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Documentary Look: how the video and thumbnail look. Each part: 'auto (from mood)' picks one that suits the mood, 'random' any, new each film (by the story's seed), or a fixed choice.\n\nfont: title + subtitle fonts. accent: the colour of labels, handles and highlights ('from photos': the subject's colour; accent_hex overrides). intro: photo collage, hero (the cover zooming in), film strip, mosaic. subtitles: outline, boxed, karaoke (the spoken word highlighted), minimal. grade: a colour grade. finish: vignette, film grain, letterbox (YouTube). follow_card: classic (Follow button) or minimal. thumbnail: classic, bold (big words beside the subject), split (two photos), framed (a print).\n\nDisconnect it for the classic look."
   ]
  },
